{"src":"ko","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":184600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ko","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7729.880605,"text":"하지만 생겐조는 이런 측면에서 다소 한 나라같이 작용한다."},{"kind":"text","t":8270.784626,"text":"However, in this respect, Schengen acts somewhat like a single country."},{"kind":"audio","t":8381.474475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":8386.038029000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8391.42023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8394.430539,"samples":24096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":14973.873674,"text":"메카 북쪽의 산 중 한 곳의 꼭대기에 자리 잡고 있는 이 동굴은"},{"kind":"text","t":15591.031987,"text":"Located at the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, this cave"},{"kind":"audio","t":15700.997397000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15706.212010000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15711.327295000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15713.920122000001,"samples":21096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":19865.708633,"text":"세계의 나머지 지역으로부터 완전히 고립되어 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":20303.957931999998,"text":"is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":20407.677157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20413.000408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20416.263164,"samples":24464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":26893.207743,"text":"이제 사람들은 컴퓨터 화면에 메시지를 쓰고 연필깎이를 가까이 할 필요가 전혀 없습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":27757.904698,"text":"Now, people no longer have any need to write messages on computer screens or keep a pencil sharpener nearby."},{"kind":"audio","t":27876.916847999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27882.096321999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27887.496651999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27892.44197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27897.683843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27900.540575,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":37218.878775,"text":"무거운 세금을 물리는 국가의 여행객들은 때때로 상당한 금액을 아낄 수 있다. 특히 주류나 담배를 살 때 그렇다."},{"kind":"text","t":37959.784268999996,"text":"Travelers from countries that impose heavy taxes can sometimes save a significant amount of money. This is especially true when buying alcohol or cigarettes."},{"kind":"audio","t":38079.540567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38084.859128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38089.870155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38095.215996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38100.616186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":38101.422963,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":38158.224038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38163.606808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38170.213557999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":38170.939596,"samples":6096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":45004.041209999996,"text":"식물들은 태양을 이용한 광합성을 통해 자신들의 음식을 만들고 또한 그늘을 제공합니다."},{"kind":"text","t":45632.144381,"text":"Plants create their own food through photosynthesis using the sun and also provide shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":45742.25492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45747.62426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45752.833474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":45757.919209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45761.317363,"samples":24928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":55585.969938999995,"text":"병원은 다른 사람들의 감염 가능성을 막기 위해 환자를 다른 사람들로부터 분리시키는 것을 포함하여 감염 통제 규칙을"},{"kind":"text","t":56422.63461,"text":"Hospitals implement infection control rules, including isolating patients from others to prevent the possibility of infecting other people."},{"kind":"audio","t":56547.731429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56553.129099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56558.419690999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56563.851401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56568.850948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56574.592072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56579.898964,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":56580.506704,"samples":12424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":56875.656824,"text":"준수했다."},{"kind":"text","t":57047.042403,"text":"followed."},{"kind":"audio","t":57146.743064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":57147.050779,"samples":1432,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66077.00951,"text":"비록 대부분 이론에 의존하긴 해도 프로그램은 궁수자리 은하관측을 시뮬레이션 하도록 짜여 있습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":66840.957661,"text":"Although it relies mostly on theory, the program is designed to simulate observations of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":66960.717649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66966.029531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":66971.129256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66976.434657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66981.645901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66986.911003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":66987.207128,"samples":1992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75458.422801,"text":"바르셀로나의 공용어는 카탈루니아어와 스페인어다. 절반 정도는 카탈로니아어를 사용하는 것을 선호하고"},{"kind":"text","t":75954.728864,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. About half of them prefer to use Catalan,"},{"kind":"audio","t":76064.593576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76066.08500199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":76067.611046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76068.052939,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":76144.632255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76145.904924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76146.253278,"samples":14864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":81491.686141,"text":"대다수가 그 언어를 이해하고 있으며 또한 거의 모든 사람들이 스페인어를 안다."},{"kind":"text","t":82049.511681,"text":"The vast majority understand the language, and almost everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":82157.720631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82159.05286899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82160.491625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82162.159097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":82162.322634,"samples":6928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":87413.556505,"text":"일부 지역에서는 1분간 물을 끓이는 것으로 충분하다."},{"kind":"text","t":87939.099102,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for one minute is sufficient."},{"kind":"audio","t":88048.59217999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":88053.548998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88058.859219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":88059.683366,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":92049.93958399999,"text":"다른 지역에서는 수분 동안 물을 끓일 필요가 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":92637.936472,"text":"In other areas, it is necessary to boil water for several minutes."},{"kind":"audio","t":92750.881763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92756.004627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92761.433857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92765.407681,"samples":28296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":99706.62327699999,"text":"식물은 자연환경에서 가장 좋아 보이므로 딱 하나의 표본은 괜찮겠지 라는 유혹은 버려야 한다."},{"kind":"text","t":100644.1522,"text":"You must resist the temptation to think that a single specimen is fine, as plants look their best in their natural environment."},{"kind":"audio","t":100765.322884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":100770.739724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":100776.062535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100781.06733199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100786.50698199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100791.717205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":100793.083802,"samples":12792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107777.234264,"text":"1920년대 대부분의 시민과 국가에서 우세했던 성향은 평화주의와 고립주의였습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":108720.798266,"text":"In the 1920s, the dominant tendencies among most citizens and nations were pacifism and isolationism."},{"kind":"audio","t":108832.037706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108837.514135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108842.986164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108848.197157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108853.503279,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108859.037807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":108860.423384,"samples":14592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113139.472798,"text":"모사사우루스는 그 시대의 최상위 포식자였으므로"},{"kind":"text","t":113834.287089,"text":"Since the Mosasaurus was the apex predator of that era,"},{"kind":"audio","t":113967.430324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113972.627237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113978.000818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":113978.28292299999,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118298.442253,"text":"다른 모사사우루스 외에는 두려울 것이 아무것도 없었습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":118818.626689,"text":"it had nothing to fear except other Mosasauruses."},{"kind":"audio","t":118988.68656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118993.859404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118999.549289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":118999.652177,"samples":4896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":130103.894357,"text":"1537년 아순시온이 설립된 이래 파라과이는 토착적인 특징과 정체성을 상당 부분 유지해 왔습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":131169.98438100002,"text":"Since the founding of Asunción in 1537, Paraguay has maintained a significant amount of its indigenous characteristics and identity."},{"kind":"audio","t":131295.784168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131301.14209900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131306.45696100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":131311.80280200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131317.267931,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131322.99082600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131328.49430400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131331.54510400002,"samples":28624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":135514.516616,"text":"이 병은 돼지에 의해 옮겨진 다음 모기를 통해 인간에게 옮겨집니다."},{"kind":"text","t":136178.786475,"text":"This disease is transmitted by pigs and then passed to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":136353.083495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136358.54869400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":136363.849706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136369.231376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":136370.029163,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145024.94526,"text":"현대 연구용 망원경의 대부분은 유리한 대기 조건을 갖춘 외딴 지역에 위치한 방대한 시설입니다."},{"kind":"text","t":145690.777903,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are vast facilities located in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":145811.801509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145817.08137200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145822.54617100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145827.910612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145832.99297700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145838.299969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145840.65308000002,"samples":18792,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":153609.063694,"text":"사람들은 귀국길에 오르는 여행객들에게도 인내심과 이해심이 필요하다고 생각하지 않을 수 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":154408.64918200002,"text":"People may not think that patience and understanding are necessary even for travelers on their way home."},{"kind":"audio","t":154580.92288600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154582.542629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154583.980045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154585.614888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154587.437998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154587.729223,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":158679.470892,"text":"그래서 단순히 라벨로 표기했을 가능성이 높다."},{"kind":"text","t":159169.952453,"text":"So it is highly likely that it was simply labeled."},{"kind":"audio","t":159275.989359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159277.53305300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159278.25833100002,"samples":26264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":164621.19044600002,"text":"하지만 여전히 새해는 공룡처럼 보이게 하는 것들이 많습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":165281.305774,"text":"But there are still many things that make the New Year look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"audio","t":165386.77566900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165392.13888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165397.53808000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165399.428829,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":175787.11215,"text":"그곳은 안전한 수영이 가능한 거의 모든 모래 해변이며 대부분의 해변은 푸우투카와 나무가 만드는 그늘진 장소들이 많다."},{"kind":"text","t":176903.769738,"text":"It is a sandy beach where safe swimming is possible almost everywhere, and most of the beach has many shaded areas created by putuka and trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":177029.53287300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177034.859375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177040.226847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177045.429272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177050.855413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177056.19888500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177060.323987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177061.88039200002,"samples":19624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":181212.75739400001,"text":"이 이야기에 관계된 두 명의 성인 자녀를 둔 기혼자인 듀발은"},{"kind":"text","t":181840.46923900003,"text":"Duval, a married man with two adult children related to this story,"},{"kind":"audio","t":181953.439374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181958.818176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":181964.375934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181967.236597,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":184399.642113,"text":"밀러에게 깊은 인상을 남기지 않아."},{"kind":"text","t":184889.23706500002,"text":"He doesn't leave a deep impression on Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":184992.167435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184997.628755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":184998.89323500003,"samples":13664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":195005.22994400002,"code":1005}]}